sequenceDiagram
    actor Developer
    participant Lead as Astra / Fable Lead
    participant Worker as Specialist Worker
    participant Repo as Shared Workspace
    Developer->>Lead: Request
    Lead->>Repo: Focused inspection
    alt Small task
        Lead->>Repo: Implement directly
    else Delegation justified
        Lead->>Worker: Objective + file scope + checks
        Worker->>Repo: Scoped implementation
        Worker-->>Lead: Changed files + test evidence + risks
        Lead->>Repo: Inspect diff and integration
    end
    Lead->>Repo: Proportional final verification
    Lead-->>Developer: Result + evidence + limitations
